{"id":"c000d6833b849019","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-implicit-definability.md","title":"Implicit Definability","display":"df-implicit-definability — Implicit Definability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-implicit-definability","aliases":["93-df-implicit-definability"],"display":"df-implicit-definability — Implicit Definability","depends_on":["[[93-df-definability]]","[[93-df-first-order-language]]","[[93-df-first-order-theory]]","[[93-df-first-order-structure]]","[[93-df-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-implicit-definability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-implicit-definability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-implicit-definability — Implicit Definability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9bb2f4d85fff40f1\" href=\"?note=9bb2f4d85fff40f1\" title=\"93-df-definability\">93-df-definability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cc9bc888c7dda430\" href=\"?note=cc9bc888c7dda430\" title=\"93-df-first-order-language\">93-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"30a8f872911e731f\" href=\"?note=30a8f872911e731f\" title=\"93-df-first-order-theory\">93-df-first-order-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0ce709e0d2857990\" href=\"?note=0ce709e0d2857990\" title=\"93-df-first-order-structure\">93-df-first-order-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2e6273b8ebf2e31a\" href=\"?note=2e6273b8ebf2e31a\" title=\"93-df-model\">93-df-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OneRelExt}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{OneRelExt}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L,R)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-theory.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright_{93}\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright_{93}\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> is the first-order reduct of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0ce709e0d2857990\" href=\"?note=0ce709e0d2857990\" title=\"93-df-first-order-structure\">93-df-first-order-structure</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}\\)</span> have their sourced signatures.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ImplDef}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ImplDef}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}implicit\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ImplDef}_{93}(R,T;\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{OneRelExt}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L,R)\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,T;\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright_{93}\\mathcal L_0=\n\\mathfrak B\\upharpoonright_{93}\\mathcal L_0\\to R^{\\mathfrak A}=R^{\\mathfrak B}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}implicit\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ImplDef}_{93}(R,T;\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{OneRelExt}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L,R)\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,T;\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright_{93}\\mathcal L_0=\n\\mathfrak B\\upharpoonright_{93}\\mathcal L_0\\to R^{\\mathfrak A}=R^{\\mathfrak B}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus any two <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>-expansions of the same <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span>-structure assign exactly the same relation to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>. This supplies the implicit side of Beth definability.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-definability","status":"resolved","id":"9bb2f4d85fff40f1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-definability]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"cc9bc888c7dda430","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-theory","status":"resolved","id":"30a8f872911e731f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ce709e0d2857990","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"2e6273b8ebf2e31a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ce709e0d2857990","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright_{93}\\mathcal L_0$ is the first-order reduct of [[93-df-first-order-structure]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{OneRelExt}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L,R)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright_{93}\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ImplDef}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}implicit\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ImplDef}_{93}(R,T;\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{OneRelExt}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L,R)\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,T;\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&\\hspace{8em}\\land\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright_{93}\\mathcal L_0=\n\\mathfrak B\\upharpoonright_{93}\\mathcal L_0\\to R^{\\mathfrak A}=R^{\\mathfrak B}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":1505,"backlinks":[{"id":"3628414839005ad6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["9bb2f4d85fff40f1","cc9bc888c7dda430","30a8f872911e731f","0ce709e0d2857990","2e6273b8ebf2e31a"]}